<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banacci raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banacci raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Brent Erensel had raised his rating for Mexico's Grupo Financiero Banacci to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a March 18 analysis, he said he raised his rating because of a recent drop in the company's share price.</p>
<p>-- Banacci's B shares were up 0.22 peso to 19.02 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
